@gateway = http://localhost:5000

### Gateway + downstream health
GET {{gateway}}/health

### Customer service via gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/dashboard/summary

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/customers?search=apex

### Leads service via gateway
GET {{gateway}}/api/leads/summary

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/leads?status=Qualified

### Convert a lead (Leads -> Customer)
POST {{gateway}}/api/leads/14/convert
